    "CoiStatement": "Disclosure The author has been an expert witness in cases involving suicide and in cases involving Lyme disease. He reports no other conflicts of interest in this work.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "1575-1587"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": {
